<title>USA: MBIA has capacity for N.C. Eastern Muni Power.</title>
<headline>MBIA has capacity for N.C. Eastern Muni Power.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp said Monday it has a limited supply of remaining secondary market insurance capacity for North Carolina Eastern Power Agency power system revenue bonds.</p>
<p>Derivatives and floating rate bonds of this issuer are not eligible for insurance.</p>
<p>MBIA said this limited capacity is available on a first-come/first-served basis and it will be offered only until 1200 EST.</p>
<p>For more information, please call 1-800-624-2669.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
